WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.880
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright must be

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.880
reminded that the Better Business Bureau is&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.520
not the correct agency for&nbsp;
dealing with containment

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.360
failures from horrible eldritch artifacts
sold by Marshall, Carter, and Dark.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.760
Marshall, Carter, and Dark&nbsp;
exist at the frightening&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.080
intersection of dark, anomalous power and

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.600
unfettered capitalism.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.040
They’re one of the most powerful groups
of interest out there, with almost unlimited

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.800
funds and an utterly ruthless desire to profit
at all costs.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.360
The Better Business Bureau are utterly toothless
against a group of their sheer, unrelenting

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:31.920
power.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.800
They can grease any palm and snap any neck.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.560
The poor, lowly BBB would not be able to land
a hit on them.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:43.120
The IRS, on the other hand, is a completely
different story…

